        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world of swords and magic, a city of many races, and you're a rookie owner who has inherited a tavern. There are tough roads ahead waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a 28-day deadline, you need to utilize everything at hand to make money. Each time you play you will meet different people, buy different equipment and experience different events. Utilizing their characteristics and matching them in the right combinations can help you find life from heavy debts, and even break through everyone's expectations to become a generation of tavern tycoons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No need to manually set up the location, you can just load up the decorations and add to the popularity of the tavern to keep the customers coming back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100580/extras/727ad3314a0fbd6d34de434209840504.avif?t=1762711575\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100580/extras_big/727ad3314a0fbd6d34de434209840504.avif?t=1762711575 width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100580/extras/764d2c52e829a619584f9b77937408ac.avif?t=1762711575\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >——————————————————————————————————————————————</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Employees of different professions and ranks, each with distinctive skills, are the key to making the tavern thrive. The employees also have colorful lives and stories, and everyone deserves a deeper friendship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100580/extras/b330d1e265a924f1e63f17ea85e10c2c.avif?t=1762711575\" width=616 height=353 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >——————————————————————————————————————————————</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With hundreds of ingredients, dishes and drinks, you'll need to carefully organize your tavern's menu, and sometimes more recipes aren't better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100580/extras/9b4dd0c0b4ff58fa8046b2a1e48cbfdb.avif?t=1762711575\" width=616 height=353 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >——————————————————————————————————————————————</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The store and guild system help you to get all kinds of equipments and props, and you can also organize activities to gain benefits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete tasks to earn extra rewards, and there are more mechanics hidden in the staff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100580/extras/d1a74e20f2d5a05c303603d16482703c.avif?t=1762711575\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >——————————————————————————————————————————————</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tavern is as much about business as it is about life. Whatever you're looking for, it's worth a revisit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X：</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world of swords and magic, a city of many races, and you're a rookie owner who has inherited a tavern. There are tough roads ahead waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a 28-day deadline, you need to utilize everything at hand to make money. Each time you play you will meet different people, buy different equipment and experience different events. Utilizing their characteristics and matching them in the right combinations can help you find life from heavy debts, and even break through everyone's expectations to become a generation of tavern tycoons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No need to manually set up the location, you can just load up the decorations and add to the popularity of the tavern to keep the customers coming back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100580/extras/727ad3314a0fbd6d34de434209840504.avif?t=1762711575\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100580/extras_big/727ad3314a0fbd6d34de434209840504.avif?t=1762711575 width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100580/extras/764d2c52e829a619584f9b77937408ac.avif?t=1762711575\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >——————————————————————————————————————————————</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Employees of different professions and ranks, each with distinctive skills, are the key to making the tavern thrive. The employees also have colorful lives and stories, and everyone deserves a deeper friendship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100580/extras/b330d1e265a924f1e63f17ea85e10c2c.avif?t=1762711575\" width=616 height=353 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >——————————————————————————————————————————————</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With hundreds of ingredients, dishes and drinks, you'll need to carefully organize your tavern's menu, and sometimes more recipes aren't better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100580/extras/9b4dd0c0b4ff58fa8046b2a1e48cbfdb.avif?t=1762711575\" width=616 height=353 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >——————————————————————————————————————————————</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The store and guild system help you to get all kinds of equipments and props, and you can also organize activities to gain benefits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete tasks to earn extra rewards, and there are more mechanics hidden in the staff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100580/extras/d1a74e20f2d5a05c303603d16482703c.avif?t=1762711575\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >——————————————————————————————————————————————</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tavern is as much about business as it is about life. Whatever you're looking for, it's worth a revisit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X：</p>",
        "short_description": "You are a rookie tavern owner who has been forced to inherit a tavern. Set up the tavern, buy equipment, complete quests, make hundreds of different dishes and drinks. Recruit skilled staffs and revitalize the tavern with their help while learning their stories, or maybe, learning about yourself?",
